{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>(GAME CURRENTLY IN ALPHA</strong>)<br><br>Immerse yourself in a beautiful cartoonistic world as Catrick Swayze, a cat that has been chosen to fulfill a quest for Tish &amp; Fipsy, space cats from another planet in search of refilling their home planet with a healthy supply of fish.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect Gadgets that will help you along your path or search for hilarious cosmetics to make the game more enjoyable as you join Catrick along with their journey.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gadgets such as a:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Laser gun</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Traffic Cone Air Cannon</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Grappling hook</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >..With many more to come</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use your gadgets to solve puzzles, blast enemies off of cliffs or just cause chaos by throwing things off the edge of the nearest surface in true cat fashion.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect  20+ hats in the current Alpha version so dress your cat up however you choose :)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Classic Plat-former/RPG gameplay across a vast open world map where you experience the world through the eyes of a cat dropped onto a mysterious planet.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight enemies, solve puzzles and explore the world in all of its entirety in hopes of discovering a way back home.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4125170?t=1762330300","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4125170?t=1762330300","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4125170/72254330b580a7851913e2eade7b17b9ec412299/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1762330300","capsule_imagev5":